      "summary": "Qualify a source-pinned post-M7 Math delivery portfolio from the five existing RS124-RS128 durable reports. Reconcile the local thirteen-package roster, seven independent consumer executions, ninety-five numbered probes and separate quantity smoke, while preserving the exact first-pass history and public/external/ABI limits. No new build, package, product milestone or publication is attempted.",
